flowchart TD
    A[Developer Push to main] -->|GitHub Webhook| B[GitHub Actions Triggered]
    B --> C[Build Job]
    C -->|npm install| D[Install Dependencies]
    D -->|npm run build| E[Generate Static Site]
    E -->|Upload artifact| F[Build Artifact Ready]
    
    F --> G[Approval Job]
    G -->|Production Environment| H{Manual Review}
    H -->|❌ Rejected| I[Deployment Cancelled]
    H -->|✅ Approved| J[Deploy Job]
    
    J -->|Azure Login| K[Authenticate to Azure]
    K --> L[Connect to Storage Account]
    L -->|Get existing files| M{Files Exist?}
    M -->|Yes| N[Create Backup]
    M -->|No| Q[Skip Backup]
    
    N -->|backup/backup1| O[Create Incremental Backup]
    O --> P[Remove Old Live Files]
    Q --> P
    P --> R[Upload New Files]
    R --> S[Set Content Types]
    S --> T[Delete Old Backups >30 days]
    
    T --> U[Verify Deployment]
    U -->|Success| V[✅ Live on Azure Storage]
    U -->|Failure| W[❌ Deployment Failed]
    V --> X[🎉 Website Live!]
    
    style A fill:#e1f5ff
    style H fill:#fff3e0
    style X fill:#c8e6c9
    style W fill:#ffcdd2
    style V fill:#a5d6a7